 "text": "GIS / Mapping | Carlton County, MN\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\n-->\nGovernment\nResidents\nVisitors\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nGIS Mapping Applications\nCounty Maps for Printing\nAddressing Authorities\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments\nGIS / Mapping\nGIS / Mapping\nQuick Links\nIMAPP - Parcel Explorer\nMobile Parcel Viewer\nGIS Data\n/QuickLinks.aspx\n2024 Aerial Imagery for GIS Software\nCarlton County’s 2024 aerial imagery is now available through WMS and WMTS. Click here for further information.\nInternal Geographic Information Systems Mapping\nInternal GIS Mapping is available at public terminals within the Carlton County Courthouse Room 205 located at 301 Walnut Avenue Carlton .\nParcels\nCustomized map requests must be requested by email, fax, or in writing.\nFees do apply to custom map production. Access Parcel Information .\n2024 Carlton County Plat Book\nThe new plat books are available for purchase from the Carlton County Extension office at 317 Chestnut Avenue in Carlton. The books are priced at $40. For more information, call 218-384-3511.\nContact Us\nJared Hovi\nGIS Coordinator\nEmail Jared Hovi\nMore Information\nViolet Forster\nGIS Specialist\nEmail Violet Forster\nMore Information\nGIS / Mapping\nContact GIS / Mapping\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n1630 County Road 61\nCarlton County Land Department\nCarlton , MN 55718\n1630 County Road 61 Carlton County Land Department Carlton MN 55718\nDirections\nPhone: 218-384-9502\nFax: 218-384-9123\nHours\nMonday - Friday\n8 a.m. - 4 p.m.\nDirectory\n-->\nBoard of Commissioners\nGIS / Maps\nPay Taxes / Parcel Info / Beacon Portal\nCareer Opportunities\nAgendas & Minutes\nNotify Me\nContact Us\nHelpful Links\nCounty Buildings\nData Request\nData Retention Policy\nData Retention Schedule\nElection Information\nEmergency Alerts\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nCounty Quick Links\nJail Roster\nLanguage Translation\nMinnesota's Property Tax Refund Programs\nWell Within Reach - Carlton County\nEmployee Email\nPaycom Employee Logon\nCarlton County Policy Manual\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nAccessibility\nPrivacy\nCopyright Notices\nStaff Directory\nEmployee Intranet\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nFollow us on Facebook\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nPageAssist\nDiscover your personalization options",
